<title>USA: Valero holders approve spin-off, merger.</title>
<headline>Valero holders approve spin-off, merger.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valero Energy Corp on Wednesday said its stockholders approved the company's spin-off and merger plan announced January 31.</p>
<p>The plan approved by Valero's stockholders would spin off all outstanding shares of its refining and marketing business to its stockholders and merge its natural gas-related services business with a wholly owned subsidiary of PG&amp;E Corp.</p>
<p>Valero said it still expected to complete the spin-off and merger in July, subject to approval from the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission.</p>
</text>
